WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:01.534 --> 00:00:02.801
-I've been doing a lot of press
for "That's My Jam."

00:00:02.801 --> 00:00:05.534
"That's My Jam" --
season two premieres Tuesday.

00:00:05.534 --> 00:00:07.934
I've been doing press.
I've been doing a lot of

00:00:07.934 --> 00:00:10.067
radio interviews and TV
interviews and stuff like that.

00:00:10.067 --> 00:00:12.334
And this morning,
I was on one of our pal's,

00:00:12.334 --> 00:00:14.467
"Elvis Duran
and The Morning Show."

00:00:14.467 --> 00:00:15.601
And I went on there --
I love him.

00:00:15.601 --> 00:00:16.734
[ Cheers and applause ]

00:00:16.734 --> 00:00:18.834
Hi, Danielle, hi, Gandhi.

00:00:18.834 --> 00:00:20.067
A great crew over there.

00:00:20.067 --> 00:00:22.033
And they wanted to play a game,
and they said,

00:00:22.033 --> 00:00:24.300
"This is such a dumb game
that we're playing."

00:00:24.300 --> 00:00:26.501
And I go, "I love dumb games.
What is it?"

00:00:26.501 --> 00:00:29.334
And it's called,
"I'm thinking of a pasta."

00:00:29.334 --> 00:00:31.334
[ Laughter ]
That's the name of the game.

00:00:31.334 --> 00:00:33.734
And I go, "Okay."
And so, the whole idea is,

00:00:33.734 --> 00:00:36.501
Elvis was just thinking of
a pasta, and I had to guess.

00:00:36.501 --> 00:00:38.334
So I thought -- I said,
"I want to take that game.

00:00:38.334 --> 00:00:39.801
I want to play it on
'The Tonight Show,'"

00:00:39.801 --> 00:00:43.734
and he goes, "You'd be out of
your mind to take that game."

00:00:43.734 --> 00:00:46.100
And I am out of my mind,
so here we go to play the game.

00:00:46.100 --> 00:00:48.634
[ Cheers and applause ]
Let's do it.

00:00:48.634 --> 00:00:49.901
So, I want to play the game.

00:00:49.901 --> 00:00:53.300
Higgins, Tariq, Questlove,
you want to play with me?

00:00:53.300 --> 00:00:55.133
I'm gonna write down a pasta.
-Okay.

00:00:55.133 --> 00:00:57.634
-I'm thinking of a pasta, okay?

00:00:57.634 --> 00:01:00.767
Eh-huh, mm-huh, mm-huh.

00:01:00.767 --> 00:01:02.300
[ Laughter ]

00:01:02.300 --> 00:01:06.133
Mm-huh, mm.
-Wait a second.

00:01:06.133 --> 00:01:07.467
-I don't want
to give anything away.

00:01:07.467 --> 00:01:08.834
All right.
Now, here we go.

00:01:08.834 --> 00:01:11.634
I'm thinking of a pasta.
Questlove, what pasta --

00:01:11.634 --> 00:01:14.801
Oh, how 'bout this?
If you guess it right,

00:01:14.801 --> 00:01:17.200
everyone in the audience
gets a pint of

00:01:17.200 --> 00:01:18.734
Tonight Dough Ben and Jerry
ice cream?

00:01:18.734 --> 00:01:27.400
[ Cheers and applause ]

00:01:27.400 --> 00:01:28.701
I'm just saying!

00:01:28.701 --> 00:01:30.601
You want to let
these people down?!

00:01:30.601 --> 00:01:33.300
[ Cheers and applause ]
Come on, man.

00:01:33.300 --> 00:01:36.167
Come on, dude!

00:01:36.167 --> 00:01:38.534
All right.
I'm thinking of a pasta.

00:01:38.534 --> 00:01:40.033
-Man, that's a lot of pressure.
-I'm thinking of a pasta.

00:01:40.033 --> 00:01:41.234
Here we go.
-Whoa.

00:01:41.234 --> 00:01:43.701
-All right.
And it falls on me to guess it.

00:01:43.701 --> 00:01:45.834
-Well, we have you, Tariq,
and then Higgins, yeah.

00:01:45.834 --> 00:01:47.300
But I'm thinking of a pasta.
-All right.

00:01:47.300 --> 00:01:49.567
I'll go easy.
I'll say rigatoni.

00:01:49.567 --> 00:01:51.067
-Ooh.

00:01:51.067 --> 00:01:53.100
-Not true.
Not good, not good.

00:01:53.100 --> 00:01:54.367
It is not rigatoni.

00:01:54.367 --> 00:01:55.801
Thank you very much.
Come on, focus up.

00:01:55.801 --> 00:01:57.133
Tariq?
[ Laughter ]

00:01:57.133 --> 00:01:59.167
I am thinking of a pasta.

00:01:59.167 --> 00:02:00.601
-Okay.
Okay.

00:02:00.601 --> 00:02:04.334
I'm gonna say, uh...

00:02:04.334 --> 00:02:06.167
fusilli.
-Ooh!

00:02:06.167 --> 00:02:07.434
[ Audience "Oohs" ]

00:02:07.434 --> 00:02:08.734
[ Laughter ]

00:02:08.734 --> 00:02:09.834
[ Sad tuba ]

00:02:09.834 --> 00:02:11.834
-What are you talking about?
Fusilli?

00:02:11.834 --> 00:02:13.701
You thought that's the pasta
I'm --

00:02:13.701 --> 00:02:16.300
-Because you're silly.
I figured silly, fusilli.

00:02:16.300 --> 00:02:17.701
All right, whatever, man.
I don't know.

00:02:17.701 --> 00:02:18.968
[ Laughter ]

00:02:18.968 --> 00:02:20.200
-I'm thinking of a pasta!

00:02:20.200 --> 00:02:22.267
Higgins, we've known each other
for 25 years.

00:02:22.267 --> 00:02:24.133
You are Italian.
-Yes.

00:02:24.133 --> 00:02:25.667
-You've been to Italy.
-Yes.

00:02:25.667 --> 00:02:27.501
-We've shared many a meal
together.

00:02:27.501 --> 00:02:30.567
I'm thinking of a pasta,
and the audience

00:02:30.567 --> 00:02:32.534
is getting ice cream
if you guess it!

00:02:32.534 --> 00:02:34.567
[ Cheers and applause ]

00:02:34.567 --> 00:02:36.934
Higgins,
I'm thinking of a pasta.

00:02:36.934 --> 00:02:39.634
-I'm gonna say, since
you've played this once before,

00:02:39.634 --> 00:02:42.033
you probably did a fancy one
like fusilli.

00:02:42.033 --> 00:02:43.634
And I'm gonna say you're
gonna go, like, every day --

00:02:43.634 --> 00:02:45.734
I'm gonna say penne.

00:02:45.734 --> 00:02:47.734
[ Audience "Oohs" ]

00:02:47.734 --> 00:02:48.868
-Penne!

00:02:48.868 --> 00:02:50.701
[ Bell dinging ]

00:02:50.701 --> 00:02:52.901
[ Cheers and applause ]

00:02:52.901 --> 00:02:54.901
[ Both laugh ]

00:02:54.901 --> 00:02:57.534
♪♪

00:02:57.534 --> 00:02:59.300
That was it!
Penne!

00:02:59.300 --> 00:03:01.834
Oh, buddy.
-Come on! Come on!

00:03:01.834 --> 00:03:03.634
Yeah!

00:03:03.634 --> 00:03:05.467
[ Cheers and applause ]

00:03:05.467 --> 00:03:08.434
-That's what I said!
Penne!

00:03:08.434 --> 00:03:10.501
Everyone's going home
with some ice cream!

00:03:10.501 --> 00:03:11.934
[ Cheers and applause ]
Who likes ice cream?

00:03:11.934 --> 00:03:13.133
[ Laughs ]

00:03:13.133 --> 00:03:15.467
-Whoo!

00:03:15.467 --> 00:03:18.634
-Ah.
I love you, Elvis.

